{"name":"Espresso Macchiato","hex":"#4f4744","fetched":"2026-10-12","looked":{"definitions":[{"term":"espresso","whole":false,"parts":[{"part":"Noun","definitions":["A concentrated coffee beverage brewed by forcing hot water under high pressure through finely ground coffee.","A drink that includes espresso as an ingredient."]}],"link":"https://en.wiktionary.org/wiki/espresso"},{"term":"macchiato","whole":false,"parts":[{"part":"Noun","definitions":["Espresso topped with steamed milk.","Ellipsis of latte macchiato."]}],"link":"https://en.wiktionary.org/wiki/macchiato"}],"entries":[{"title":"Espresso Macchiato (song)","blocks":[{"text":"\"Espresso Macchiato\" is a song by Estonian rapper Tommy Cash. It was written by the artist and Johannes Naukkarinen. The song was self-released on 6 December 2024. Self-described as a song that details the story of an Italian man that features numerous references to stereotypes of Italian culture, \"Espresso Macchiato\" represented Estonia in the Eurovision Song Contest 2025, where it placed third with 356 points."}],"image":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/en/4/47/Tommy_Cash_-_Espresso_Macchiato.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=api&utm_content=thumbnail_unscaled","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Espresso_Macchiato_(song)"},{"title":"Caffè macchiato","blocks":[{"text":"Caffè macchiato is an espresso with a small amount of milk, usually foamed. In Italian, macchiato means 'stained' or 'spotted', so the literal translation of caffè macchiato is 'stained coffee' or 'marked coffee'."}],"image":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/f/fc/Macchiato_%287199366530%29.jpg/330px-Macchiato_%287199366530%29.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=api&utm_content=thumbnail","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Caff%C3%A8_macchiato"},{"title":"Espresso","blocks":[{"text":"Espresso is a concentrated form of coffee produced by forcing hot water under high pressure through finely ground coffee beans. Originating in Italy, espresso has become one of the most popular coffee-brewing methods worldwide. It is characterized by its small serving size, typically 25–30 ml, and its distinctive layers: a dark body topped with a lighter-colored foam called \"crema\"."}],"image":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/a/a5/Tazzina_di_caff%C3%A8_a_Ventimiglia.jpg/330px-Tazzina_di_caff%C3%A8_a_Ventimiglia.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=api&utm_content=thumbnail","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Espresso"}],"images":[{"srcset":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/5/58/Tommy_Cash_at_ESC2025_for_Estonia_10_%28cropped%29.jpg/500px-Tommy_Cash_at_ESC2025_for_Estonia_10_%28cropped%29.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail 1x, https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/5/58/Tommy_Cash_at_ESC2025_for_Estonia_10_%28cropped%29.jpg/1280px-Tommy_Cash_at_ESC2025_for_Estonia_10_%28cropped%29.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail 2x","src":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/5/58/Tommy_Cash_at_ESC2025_for_Estonia_10_%28cropped%29.jpg/500px-Tommy_Cash_at_ESC2025_for_Estonia_10_%28cropped%29.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail","alt":"\"Espresso Macchiato\" was sung by Estonian rapper Tommy Cash (pictured in 2025).","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/File%3ATommy_Cash_at_ESC2025_for_Estonia_10_(cropped).jpg"},{"srcset":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/e/e1/Gian_Marco_Centinaio_datisenato_2022.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail_unscaled 1x","src":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/e/e1/Gian_Marco_Centinaio_datisenato_2022.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail_unscaled","alt":"Some Italian politicians and organizations, including Lega Nord member Gian Marco Centinaio, unsuccessfully called for the song's exclusion.","l